      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into issue/110-pause-home\n\nResolves 17 conflicts against main. Main's PostOptions singleton and\nSetPostOptions command (#34, threading) absorb this branch's twin:\nPostOptions is now { threading, skip_stops, per_op }, one command\n(commands::post_options), one reader (posting::post_options). The\nproject reader lands all three in one write (the old second write\nwiped threading); skip_stops / per_op_files keep their top-level keys.\nop_streams keeps main's motion count (Move/Touch/Retreat) for cycle\nanchors in the join; per-op files post with the document's options\n(engine::run_numbered_with). Posts keep main's coolantOp and this\nbranch's afterAsk. This branch's RECOMMENDED.md entries move verbatim\nto docs/decisions/110-pause-home.md and 111-nc-per-op.md; RECOMMENDED.md\nis main's.\n\nRefs #110\nRefs #111\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
